WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:06.520
She's one of the most talked about women in
Pakistan - Asia Bibi, pictured shortly after

00:00:06.520 --> 00:00:09.000
she was convicted in 2010.

00:00:09.000 --> 00:00:13.530
The Christian mother of five was sentenced
to death for alleged remarks about Islam during

00:00:13.530 --> 00:00:15.890
a row with fellow farm workers.

00:00:15.890 --> 00:00:19.590
They'd refused to share their water glass
with a non-Muslim.

00:00:19.590 --> 00:00:21.900
Now free, she lives in hiding.

00:00:21.900 --> 00:00:26.859
No longer on death row, but still in constant
fear for her life.

00:00:26.859 --> 00:00:28.269
And this is why.

00:00:28.269 --> 00:00:33.650
Hardline Islamists, calling for her to be
hanged.

00:00:33.650 --> 00:00:42.229
Her acquittal in October last year triggered
a day of nationwide demonstrations.

00:00:42.229 --> 00:00:46.879
In every corner of the country, the sons of
Islam have voiced opposition to the Supreme

00:00:46.879 --> 00:00:50.559
Court verdict by going into the streets.

00:00:50.559 --> 00:00:55.929
What kind of verdict is this from the Supreme
Court of an Islamic republic which is troubling

00:00:55.929 --> 00:00:59.019
Muslims but satisfying infidels?

00:00:59.019 --> 00:01:06.630
The protests were only called off when the
government agreed to bar Bibi from leaving

00:01:06.630 --> 00:01:10.090
the country - pending today's verdict.

00:01:10.090 --> 00:01:15.350
But this is a case already linked to the killings
of at least two people.

00:01:15.350 --> 00:01:20.250
The governor of Punjab province, Salman Taseer,
seen here on the right, was assassinated by

00:01:20.250 --> 00:01:25.320
his bodyguard in 2011 after speaking in Bibi's
defence.

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:30.680
Later the same year, Federal minister for
minorities Shahbaz Bhatti was killed after

00:01:30.680 --> 00:01:33.759
calling for her release.

00:01:33.759 --> 00:01:37.880
Today's verdict is likely to do little to
appease those who will settle for nothing

00:01:37.880 --> 00:02:25.700
less than having 
Asia

00:02:25.700 --> 00:03:27.870
Bibi's death

00:03:27.870 --> 00:04:20.130
sentence reinstated.

